@.str.23 = private unnamed_addr constant [853 x i8] c"\0AChecks if the rays have any intersection with the scene.\0A\0AArgs:\0A    rays (open3d.core.Tensor): A tensor with >=2 dims, shape {.., 6}, and Dtype\0A        Float32 describing the rays.\0A        {..} can be any number of dimensions, e.g., to organize rays for\0A        creating an image the shape can be {height, width, 6}.\0A        The last dimension must be 6 and has the format [ox, oy, oz, dx, dy, dz]\0A        with [ox,oy,oz] as the origin and [dx,dy,dz] as the direction. It is not\0A        necessary to normalize the direction.\0A\0A    tnear (float): The tnear offset for the rays. The default is 0.\0A\0A    tfar (float): The tfar value for the ray. The default is infinity.\0A\0A    nthreads (int): The number of threads to use. Set to 0 for automatic.\0A\0AReturns:\0A    A boolean tensor which indicates if the ray is occluded by the scene (true)\0A    or not (false).\0A\00", align 1
